but there has been an adjustment to Quant Trading App

476
00:28:02,231 --> 00:28:06,733
this summer where it aggregates and caches the profile just a couple minutes after the market opens.

477
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:12,600
Because sometimes 15 minutes might be a little bit too long for days in which the price action moves very quickly.

478
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:15,016
And I've spoken to some of you traders and you

479
00:28:15,016 --> 00:28:18,157
guys, some of you actually do like to trade within the first 15 minutes.

480
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:20,900
So that's why this was actually adjusted.

481
00:28:21,100 --> 00:28:24,900
There are some other updates that are coming to Quant Trading App over the next couple months.

482
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,200
Stay tuned for those.

483
00:28:26,700 --> 00:28:28,800
Again, link is in the description to Quant Trading App.

484
00:28:29,100 --> 00:28:31,300
Thanks for watching, guys. I'll catch you in the next one.

